WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
So, first we have this. I believe it's

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.560
called

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.640
steel wool?

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.840
It comes from

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.800
robot sheep.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.440
I learned this

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.880
while doing my research. So, it kind of

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.360
scratches off all the dead skin and

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.280
gets rid of any unwanted scales and

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.880
such.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:22.960
Mhm.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.400
I tried it and it's really quite

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.160
relaxing. How does that feel?

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.080
Oh.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.600
I think this is normal.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.200
Your skin is supposed to turn red before

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.080
it

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.520
turns smooth.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.080
I think so, yeah.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:47.080
Does this make you super happy?

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.880
I can tell by the way your cheeks are

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:54.760
turning red that you're so happy.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:59.760
You look so cute like that.
